<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Submit checkout with an invalid email missing the domain (buyer@), a street address shorter than five characters (12 Main), a city (Pune), a six-digit PIN code (560001), and a 16-digit demo card number (4242424242424242); confirm email and address errors appear and the order is not placed.</description>
   <name>Checkout rejects malformed email and too-short street address</name>
